}, "waitLast": "-11:econ_principles_1:am"}, "daily": {"gym": {"seen": [], "fit": 1, "fitDay": -15, "upIx": 0}}, "invites": [], "msgs": [{"day": -32, "h": 20, "who": null, "text": "迎新宿營 8/22～8/24，三天兩夜，山上的青年活動中心。新生都要參加，車子、住宿、吃的系學會處理。8/22 早上八點半校門集合。", "iv": null, "th": "g:law_new", "from": "law_assoc", "name": "系學會"}, {"day": -26, "h": 21, "who": null, "text": "（小隊名單貼出來了。第七小隊七個人，你認得的只有自己的名字。）", "iv": null, "th": "g:law_new"}, {"day": -24, "h": 20, "who": "classmate_peishan", "text": "加了沛珊的聯絡方式。", "iv": null}, {"day": -23, "h": 21, "who": null, "text": "📷（小隊合照）", "iv": null, "th": "g:camp_squad_y1", "from": "classmate_xinci", "name": "芯慈", "tag": "camp_squad_photo"}, {"day": -23, "h": 21.01, "who": null, "text": "宿營辛苦了。", "iv": null, "th": "g:camp_squad_y1", "from": "classmate_xinci", "name": "芯慈", "tag": "camp_squad_photo"}, {"day": -23, "h": 21.02, "who": null, "text": "我只有半張臉在裡面", "iv": null, "th": "g:camp_squad_y1", "from": "classmate_peishan", "name": "沛珊", "tag": "camp_squad_photo"}, {"day": -18, "h": 17.5, "who": "zhe", "text": "我在高鐵上了。", "iv": null, "th": "p:zhe", "from": "zhe", "name": "阿哲", "tag": "camp_squad_829"}, {"day": -18, "h": 17.51, "who": "zhe", "text": "七點到宿舍。你到了沒？", "iv": null, "th": "p:zhe", "from": "zhe", "name": "阿哲", "tag": "camp_squad_829"}, {"day": -18, "h": 22.67, "who": "kai", "text": "你的冷氣遙控器在我這", "iv": null, "th": "p:kai", "from": "kai", "ask": {"id": "scene_p:kai_-18_2267", "opts": [{"t": "你可以直接講啊", "say": [{"from": "kai", "text": "我耳機戴著 懶得拿下來"}, {"from": "kai", "text": "幾度"}]}, {"t": "好 開幾度", "say": [{"from": "kai", "text": "27 可以嗎 我怕冷"}]}]}, "ans": 0}, {"day": -18, "h": 22.67, "who": null, "text": "你可以直接講啊", "iv": null, "th": "p:kai", "from": "player"}, {"day": -18, "h": 22.67, "who": "kai", "text": "我耳機戴著 懶得拿下來", "iv": null, "th": "p:kai", "from": "kai"}, {"day": -18, "h": 22.67, "who": "kai", "text": "幾度", "iv": null, "th": "p:kai", "from": "kai"}, {"day": -17, "h": 21, "who": null, "text": "學弟妹好～我是 Kevin，大二。先講幾件事：開學前先不要買二手書，等學長姐的；民總很重要；有問題就問，先自己查一下也可以。", "iv": null, "th": "g:family_law", "from": "kevin", "name": "Kevin", "pin": true, "tag": "fam_w0"}, {"day": -17, "h": 21.01, "who": null, "text": "新的家族學弟妹都進群了嗎？", "iv": null, "th": "g:family_law", "from": "kevin", "name": "Kevin", "tag": "fam_w0"}, {"day": -17, "h": 21.02, "who": null, "text": "有進來的舉個手，考古題茶會那天給你們。", "iv": null, "th": "g:family_law", "from": "kevin", "name": "Kevin", "tag": "fam_w0", "ask": {"opts": [{"t": "（舉手）", "set": {"FAM_GROUP_REPLIED": true}, "say": [{"th": "g:family_law", "from": "kevin", "name": "Kevin", "text": "好，收到一個。"}]}, {"t": "我在。", "set": {"FAM_GROUP_REPLIED": true}, "say": [{"th": "g:family_law", "from": "kevin", "name": "Kevin", "text": "好，收到一個。"}]}], "id": "a1"}}, {"day": -16, "h": 14, "who": null, "text": "你被加進「法律系（全班）」。", "iv": null, "th": "g:law_class", "tag": "law_class_join"}, {"day": -16, "h": 14.01, "who": null, "text": "新生茶會：9/2（二）18:30，法律系館B一樓大廳。會說家族怎麼分，有點心。", "iv": null, "th": "g:law_class", "from": "law_assoc", "name": "系學會", "tag": "law_class_join"}, {"day": -16, "h": 14.02, "who": null, "text": "不用報名，來就好。", "iv": null, "th": "g:law_class", "from": "law_assoc", "name": "系學會", "tag": "law_class_join"}, {"day": -16, "h": 14.25, "who": null, "text": "請問要穿系服嗎", "iv": null, "th": "g:law_class", "name": "同學", "tag": "law_class_q"}, {"day": -16, "h": 14.26, "who": null, "text": "我們還沒有系服吧", "iv": null, "th": "g:law_class", "name": "同學", "tag": "law_class_q"}, {"day": -15, "h": 8, "who": null, "text": "9/6（六）10:00～16:00　社團博覽會（椰影大道）", "iv": null, "th": "sys", "name": "行事曆", "tag": "fair_y1_cal"}, {"day": -15, "h": 12.32, "who": null, "text": "（群組）Alison：張教授今天又發了二十頁講義，我幫你拿了一份。", "iv": null}, {"day": -15, "h": 21, "who": null, "text": "203 的群組", "iv": null, "th": "g:r203", "from": "zhe", "tag": "rt_r203_0901_0"}, {"day": -15, "h": 21, "who": null, "text": "大家好，我是怡君，台中人，喜歡貓。請多指教。", "iv": null, "th": "g:law_board", "name": "怡君", "tag": "sis_b_intro"}, {"day": -15, "h": 21.01, "who": null, "text": "誰帶了吹風機", "iv": null, "th": "g:r203", "from": "zhe", "tag": "rt_r203_0901_0"}, {"day": -15, "h": 21.01, "who": null, "text": "我是家瑋，高雄來的，興趣是看電影。", "iv": null, "th": "g:law_board", "name": "家瑋", "tag": "sis_b_intro"}, {"day": -15, "h": 21.02, "who": null, "text": "大家好，我是祐廷，財經法學組，澄嶼高中畢業。興趣是數學跟睡覺。請多指教。", "iv": null, "th": "g:law_board", "from": "player", "tag": "sis_b_intro"}, {"day": -15, "h": 21.03, "who": null, "text": "我是品萱，宜蘭人。第一次住宿舍，有點緊張。", "iv": null, "th": "g:law_board", "name": "品萱", "tag": "sis_b_intro"}, {"day": -15, "h": 21.03, "who": null, "text": "我有。在第二個抽屜。", "iv": null, "th": "g:r203", "from": "classmate_bohan", "tag": "rt_r203_0901_1"}, {"day": -15, "h": 21.08, "who": null, "text": "所以吹風機要排隊嗎", "iv": null, "th": "g:r203", "from": "kai", "tag": "rt_r203_0901_2"}, {"day": -14, "h": 12.5, "who": null, "text": "歡迎學弟。選課或宿舍有問題，可以私訊問我。", "iv": null, "th": "g:law_board", "from": "heroine_05", "name": "溫書瑀", "ytFix": 1, "tag": "sis_b_comment"}, {"day": -13, "h": 12.32, "who": null, "text": "（群組）阿哲：吳教授今天一個「行為」講了一整個早上。你沒錯過什麼，也錯過了全部。", "iv": null}, {"day": -13, "h": 21, "who": null, "text": "學姊好，謝謝妳的留言。想問一下，民總要先買哪一本嗎？", "iv": null, "th": "p:heroine_05", "from": "player", "tag": "sis_b_dm"}, {"day": -13, "h": 21.01, "who": "heroine_05", "text": "先不要買。第一堂課老師會說用哪一本。", "iv": null, "th": "p:heroine_05", "from": "heroine_05", "ytFix": 1, "tag": "sis_b_dm"}, {"day": -13, "h": 21.02, "who": "heroine_05", "text": "真的想先看的話，系圖有，二樓。", "iv": null, "th": "p:heroine_05", "from": "heroine_05", "ytFix": 1, "tag": "sis_b_dm"}, {"day": -13, "h": 21.03, "who": null, "text": "好，謝謝學姊。", "iv": null, "th": "p:heroine_05", "from": "player", "tag": "sis_b_dm"}, {"day": -13, "h": 21.04, "who": "heroine_05", "text": "不會。", "iv": null, "th": "p:heroine_05", "from": "heroine_05", "ytFix": 1, "tag": "sis_b_dm"}, {"day": -12, "h": 21, "who": null, "text": "禮拜六社博！系籃的攤位在晨思鐘旁邊，大一的來找學長聊聊～", "iv": null, "th": "g:law_class", "from": "law_assoc", "name": "系學會", "tag": "fair_y1_dept"}, {"day": -12, "h": 21, "who": null, "text": "家族群組開好了。學弟。", "iv": null, "th": "g:family_law", "from": "kevin", "name": "Kevin", "tag": "sis_b_fam"}, {"day": -12, "h": 21.01, "who": null, "text": "上面那位是你的直屬學姊。", "iv": null, "th": "g:family_law", "from": "kevin", "name": "Kevin", "tag": "sis_b_fam"}, {"day": -12, "h": 21.02, "who": null, "text": "學弟好。我們留言區見過了。", "iv": null, "th": "g:family_law", "from": "heroine_05", "name": "溫學姊", "ytFix": 1, "tag": "sis_b_fam"}, {"day": -12, "h": 21.03, "who": null, "text": "你們認識？", "iv": null, "th": "g:family_law", "from": "kevin", "name": "Kevin", "tag": "sis_b_fam"}, {"day": -12, "h": 21.04, "who": null, "text": "他自介我有留言。", "iv": null, "th": "g:family_law", "from": "heroine_05", "name": "溫學姊", "ytFix": 1, "tag": "sis_b_fam"}], "contacts": {"classmate_peishan": -24, "kai": -18, "heroine_01": -11}, "phone": {"groups": {"law_new": {"name": "法律系 114 新生（系學會）", "day": 1}, "camp_squad_y1": {"name": "第七小隊", "day": 1}, "family_law": {"name": "法律系直屬家族", "day": -18}, "law_class": {"name": "法律系（全班）", "day": -16}, "law_board": {"name": "法律系新生（自介版）", "day": -16}, "r203": {"name": "203", "day": -14}, "home": {"name": "家人", "day": -12}}, "seen": {}, "q": [{"day": -11, "h": 21, "items": [{"th": "p:zhe", "from": "zhe", "text": "明天社博要不要一起去？"}, {"th": "p:zhe", "from": "zhe", "text": "十點，晨思鐘。我要去系籃那攤。", "ask": {"id": "aa613_zhe_fair", "until": -228, "opts": [{"t": "好。", "set": {"AA613_ZHE_FAIR": -10}}, {"t": "我晚點自己去。"}]}}], "tag": "aa613_zhe_fair"}, {"day": -11, "h": 21.166666666666668, "items": [{"th": "g:camp_squad_y1", "from": "classmate_xinci", "name": "芯慈", "text": "明天社博有人要去嗎？我想去看合唱團。"}, {"th": "g:camp_squad_y1", "from": "classmate_peishan", "name": "沛珊", "text": "我！我十一點才能到。"}], "tag": "aa613_squad"}, {"day": 15, "h": 21, "items": [{"th": "p:zhe", "from": "zhe", "text": "中秋烤肉，河濱，七點。飲料自己帶。", "ask": {"until": 451, "opts": [{"t": "去。", "set": {"BBQ_YES": true}}, {"t": "這次不行。", "set": {"BBQ_NO": true}}]}}], "tag": "bbq_ask"}, {"day": -11, "h": 20, "items": [{"th": "g:family_law", "from": "kevin", "name": "Kevin", "text": "周老師說的那本，我有舊的。"}, {"th": "g:family_law", "from": "kevin", "name": "Kevin", "text": "📷（一本書的封面，邊角捲起來）"}, {"th": "g:family_law", "from": "kevin", "name": "Kevin", "text": "要的說，先說先拿。", "ask": {"opts": [{"t": "我要。", "set": {"KEVIN_OLD_BOOK": true}, "say": [{"th": "g:family_law", "from": "kevin", "name": "Kevin", "text": "好，下禮拜一放系學會辦公室，寫你名字。"}]}]}}], "tag": "kevin_old_book"}, {"day": -11, "h": 21, "items": [{"th": "g:family_law", "from": "kevin", "name": "Kevin", "text": "明天社博！書瑀學姊在法服顧攤，大一的去打個招呼～"}], "tag": "fair_y1_kevin"}, {"day": -7, "h": 22, "items": [{"th": "g:law_class", "from": "classmate_peishan", "name": "沛珊", "text": "請問有人知道民總的指定教科書要買哪一本嗎"}, {"th": "g:law_class", "from": "classmate_peishan", "name": "沛珊", "text": "老師說了兩本 我只抄到一本"}, {"th": "g:law_class", "from": "zhe", "name": "阿哲", "text": "我有學長的舊版 你要的話我拍給你"}, {"th": "g:law_class", "from": "classmate_peishan", "name": "沛珊", "text": "好 謝謝！"}], "tag": "ps_w2_msg"}], "n": 1, "fav": [], "filmRen": 1, "worldRen": 1}, "goal": "今天沒有課。自由活動：去圖書館、公館，或找人聊天", "goalDest": null, "outings": [], "home": {"at": false, "used": {}, "ate": {}}, "dateLog": {"classmate_peishan": {"count": 0, "wishKnown": false, "wish": false, "byLoc": {}, "cancels": [], "last": null}, "heroine_01": {"count": 0, "wishKnown": false, "wish": false, "byLoc": {}, "cancels": [], "last": null}, "heroine_03": {"count": 0, "wishKnown": false, "wish": false, "byLoc": {}, "cancels": [], "last": null}, "heroine_02": {"count": 0, "wishKnown": false, "wish": false, "byLoc": {}, "cancels": [], "last": null}, "heroine_04": {"count": 0, "wishKnown": false, "wish": false, "byLoc": {}, "cancels": [], "last": null}, "heroine_05": {"count": 0, "wishKnown": false, "wish": false, "byLoc": {}, "cancels": [], "last": null}, "kexin": {"count": 0, "wishKnown": false, "wish": false, "byLoc": {}, "cancels": [], "last": null}, "classmate_xinci": {"count": 0, "wishKnown": false, "wish": false, "byLoc": {}, "cancels": [], "last": null}, "_daily":